        },
        {
          "text": "Should be level with the philtrum",
          "timestamp": 254
        },
        {
          "text": "Weesan dulmakgi is a technique where your arms are crossed in front of your chest.",
          "timestamp": 236.6,
          "source": "caption"
        },
        {
          "text": "The inner arm blocks the lower body, and the outer arm performs olgul anpalmok bakkadmakgi.",
          "timestamp": 242.7,
          "source": "caption"
        },
        {
          "text": "The wrist of the arm performing anpalmok olgul bakkadmakgi should be level with the philtrum,",
          "timestamp": 250.0,
          "source": "caption"
        }
      ],
      "video_timestamp_end": 275.0
    },
    {
